                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A short metroidvania that stands out both visually and mechanically. Controlling a UFO that can freely fly around and use various abilities helps it stand out from other metroidvanias, which are often more focused on platforming. The game is relatively short, so there isn't as huge a world to explore as in other metroidvainas, but there are still a lot to explore and discover, with multiple distinct environments. There are also various puzzles throughout the world that make good use of the abilities and upgrades you acquire as you progress.",
